      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The limits you're asking for already exist in VRChat: https://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/avatar-performance-ranking-system/\n\nAfter exceeding the physbone cap in the performance rank chosen by the group instance performance gating or the user setting \"Block Poorly Optimized Avatars\", all physbone components will be removed.\n\nVery Poor will always be unbound in performance.\n\nSafety Settings are not meant to be a performance feature.",
