  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Please add a feature to the safety settings that allows users to disable Physbone components.\n\nThis is intended for users who have created avatars that aren’t optimized in Avatar Editor, those who are new to VR Chat and don’t yet know the best practices for avatar customization—and thus end up adding too many components, resulting in avatars that are too resource-intensive—as well as to accommodate the varying PC specifications of users in crowded environments.\n\nDeepLで翻訳しました (https://dee.pl/app)",
